Step 5: Physical interpretation of generators
============================================================
  Each generator is a direction in log-Pi space along which the
  pore fraction is preserved: simultaneously rescaling the
  dimensionless groups along g keeps the LPBF physics invariant.

  Generator 1:
    Pi1 x exp(+0.226*eps), Pi2 x exp(-0.542*eps), Pi3 x exp(+0.613*eps), Pi4 x exp(-0.175*eps), Pi5 x exp(+0.091*eps), Pi6 x exp(-0.212*eps), Pe_vap x exp(-0.213*eps), Pr x exp(+0.388*eps)
    Meaning: increase Pi3 while increase Pi1, decrease Pi2, decrease Pi4, increase Pi5, decrease Pi6, decrease Pe_vap, increase Pr
